{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06088","headline":"投道一师兰若宿 · 王维","name":"投道一师兰若宿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一公栖太白，高顶出风烟。\n梵流诸壑遍，花雨一峰偏。\n迹爲无心隐，名因立教传。\n鸟来还语法，客去更安禅。\n昼涉松路尽，暮投兰若边。\n洞房隐深竹，清夜闻遥泉。\n向是云霞里，今成枕席前。\n岂唯暂留宿，服事将穷年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}